claim_need_columnar	For vectorization to pay off, a data source that returns columns is needed, hence the task of building the MergeTree family of engines into PostgreSQL and catching up with ClickHouse on ClickBench	thesis	problem	NULL	NULL	{columnar_storage,mergetree,pg_vexec}
claim_no_columnar_source	On unmodified PostgreSQL 19 there is not a single storage that would hand the vectorized executor data column by column	argument	problem	{claim_need_columnar}	NULL	{columnar_storage,pg_vexec,table_access_method}
