claim_use_case	PostgreSQL with extensions suits a huge metrics table with hundreds of columns next to transactional data from different systems and joins between tables, all in one transaction	argument	conclusion	{claim_postgres_can_compete}	NULL	{ch_table_engines,mergetree,postgresql}
