claim_citus_hydra_rows	Citus columnar and Hydra are columnar inside, but through the tableAM API they hand out slots one row at a time	example	problem	{citus_columnar,hydra_columnar,table_access_method}
claim_custom_glue	MergeTree cannot be built into PostgreSQL by simple linking: a glue layer of its own was needed	thesis	method	{ch_table_engines,libchte_engine,mergetree}
